<main id="main-content">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    {{#items.0}}
    <a class="hero-update" href="{{_microfeed.web_url}}">
      <span class="hero-update-title">{{title}}</span>
      <span class="hero-update-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
    {{/items.0}}
    {{^items.0}}
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Open source · Built for Cloudflare</p>
    {{/items.0}}
    <h1 id="hero-title">
      <span>
        An agentic CMS for
        <em class="hero-rotating-word" aria-hidden="true"></em>
        <span class="sr-only">podcasts, blogs, photos, documents, videos, and URLs</span>
      </span>
      <span>Self-hosted on <strong>Cloudflare</strong></span>
    </h1>
    <ul class="hero-badges" aria-label="microfeed highlights">
      <li>Agentic</li>
      <li>Open Source</li>
      <li>Serverless</li>
      <li>Free</li>
      <li>Headless</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button-primary" href="https://docs.microfeed.org/start-here/">Get started for free</a>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-whats-new text-link" href="#whats-new">What’s new <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </section>

  <section class="product-shot" aria-label="microfeed administration interface preview">
    <div
      id="microfeed-product-carousel-root"
      data-home-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-home.png"
      data-edit-channel-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-edit-channel.png"
      data-api-overview-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-api-overview.png"
      data-all-items-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-all-items.png"
      data-site-files-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-site-files.png"
      data-theme-editor-image-url="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-theme-editor.png"
    >
      <figure class="product-carousel-fallback">
        <img
          src="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}admin-home.png"
          alt="The microfeed admin home page showing public access links and the setup checklist"
          width="3206"
          height="2160"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="deploy-section" aria-labelledby="deploy-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-kicker">Deploy</span>
      <h2 id="deploy-title">From prompt to live in one step.</h2>
      <p>Your coding agent guides account authorization, resource setup, deployment, and first admin access.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="deploy-steps">
      <li class="deploy-step">
        <span class="deploy-number">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Ask your coding agent</h3>
          <div class="copyable-text" data-copyable>
            <code class="agent-line" data-copy-value>Run npx @microfeed/cli manage</code>
            <span class="copy-text-button-root" data-copy-button-root data-copy-label="prompt"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="deploy-note"><strong>Then follow the prompts.</strong> The supported tools handle the Cloudflare details and guide you through the rest.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="capabilities-band" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="capabilities">
      <div class="capabilities-heading">
        <span class="section-kicker">Why microfeed</span>
        <h2 id="capabilities-title">Simple where it should be. Open where it matters.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="capability-grid">
        <article class="capability">
          <span class="capability-number">01</span>
          <h3>Agentic</h3>
          <p>Agents can help set up your site and manage content through documented, reviewable workflows.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="capability">
          <span class="capability-number">02</span>
          <h3>Headless</h3>
          <p>An ergonomic REST API makes it easy to connect automations, applications, and other tools.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="capability">
          <span class="capability-number">03</span>
          <h3>Serverless</h3>
          <p>Cloudflare runs the application and storage. R2 includes 10 GB on the free tier.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="capability">
          <span class="capability-number">04</span>
          <h3>Sensible defaults</h3>
          <p>Start with a complete site, then export the theme and customize every public view.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="workflow-section" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
    <figure class="agent-shot">
      <img
        class="agent-screenshot"
        src="{{_theme.asset_base_url}}coding-agent-deploy.png"
        alt="A coding agent deploying microfeed to Cloudflare and reporting the production resources it created"
        width="2476"
        height="2162"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="workflow-copy">
      <span class="section-kicker">People + agents</span>
      <h2 id="workflow-title">Use the admin UI. Or ask an agent.</h2>
      <p>Use the admin UI yourself, or hand a clear task to an AI coding agent (e.g., OpenAI Codex). Try one of these real prompts.</p>
      <ul class="agent-prompts">
        <li class="agent-prompt">
          <details>
            <summary>Deploy to production</summary>
            <div class="agent-prompt-text copyable-text" data-copyable>
              <code data-copy-value>Run npx @microfeed/cli manage</code>
              <span class="copy-text-button-root" data-copy-button-root data-copy-label="prompt"></span>
            </div>
          </details>
        </li>
        <li class="agent-prompt">
          <details>
            <summary>Draft a podcast episode</summary>
            <div class="agent-prompt-text copyable-text" data-copyable>
              <code data-copy-value>Upload the attached audio file and draft show notes for a new episode. Keep it unpublished for now.</code>
              <span class="copy-text-button-root" data-copy-button-root data-copy-label="prompt"></span>
            </div>
          </details>
        </li>
        <li class="agent-prompt">
          <details>
            <summary>Build a custom theme</summary>
            <div class="agent-prompt-text copyable-text" data-copyable>
              <code data-copy-value>Export the current theme and build me a theme like the GitHub home page, then import it back into the current instance.</code>
              <span class="copy-text-button-root" data-copy-button-root data-copy-label="prompt"></span>
            </div>
          </details>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="updates" id="whats-new" aria-labelledby="updates-title">
    <div class="updates-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="section-kicker">Project updates</span>
        <h2 id="updates-title">What’s new?</h2>
        <p>Release notes, new capabilities, and lessons from building microfeed in public.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="subscribe-links" aria-label="Subscribe to microfeed updates">
        {{#_microfeed.subscribe_methods}}
        <a class="subscribe-link" href="{{url}}">
          {{#image}}<img src="{{image}}" alt="" />{{/image}}
          {{name}}
        </a>
        {{/_microfeed.subscribe_methods}}
      </div>
    </div>

    {{^items.length}}
    <div class="empty-state">No updates have been published yet.</div>
    {{/items.length}}

    <ol class="update-list">
      {{#items}}
      <li>
        <a class="update-row" href="{{_microfeed.web_url}}">
          <span class="update-title">{{title}} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          <time class="update-date" datetime="{{date_published}}">{{_microfeed.date_published_short}}</time>
        </a>
      </li>
      {{/items}}
    </ol>

    <nav class="pagination" aria-label="Changelog pagination">
      {{#_microfeed.items_prev_cursor}}
      <a href="?prev_cursor={{_microfeed.items_prev_cursor}}&sort={{_microfeed.items_sort_order}}">← Newer</a>
      {{/_microfeed.items_prev_cursor}}
      {{#_microfeed.items_next_cursor}}
      <a href="?next_cursor={{_microfeed.items_next_cursor}}&sort={{_microfeed.items_sort_order}}">Older →</a>
      {{/_microfeed.items_next_cursor}}
    </nav>
  </section>
</main>
